request.description:
### POST GoRest Users

This endpoint allows you to create a new user in the GoRest system.

#### Request Body

- `name` (string, required): The name of the user.

- `gender` (string, required): The gender of the user.

- `email` (string, required): The email of the user.

- `status` (string, required): The status of the user.


#### Response

The response is a JSON object with the following schema:

``` json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "code": {
      "type": "number"
    },
    "meta": {
      "type": "null"
    },
    "data": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "name": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "email": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "gender": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "status": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}

 ```

